# Employee Data Cleaning

## Project Overview
This project demonstrates employee data cleaning and organization using Microsoft Excel.

## Tasks Performed
- Removed unnecessary spaces from names
- Standardized name capitalization
- Standardized department names
- Standardized city names
- Identified and handled missing email data
- Formatted salary data
- Created a summary of employee salary information

## Dataset
The dataset contains:
- Employee ID
- Name
- Department
- Email
- City
- Salary

## Results
- Total Employees: 30
- Average Salary: ₹36,166.67
- Highest Salary: ₹46,000
- Lowest Salary: ₹28,000

